OL,3,GNEWSAHow a historical lighthouse was
OL,4,Asaved from dereliction
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen you think of the historical
OL,7,Flandmarks on the north west of England
OL,8,Fcoast, a lighthouse in Wirral might not
OL,9,Fimmediately spring to mind.
OL,11,FBut did you know Leasowe is home to
OL,12,Fwhat is considered to be the oldest
OL,13,Fsurviving brick-built lighthouse in the
OL,14,FUK?
OL,16,FBuilt in 1763 and standing 110ft high
OL,17,F(34m), the lighthouse helped to reduce
OL,18,Fshipwrecks on the dangerous sandbanks
OL,19,Fof Liverpool Bay for decades - but
OL,20,Fafter becoming obsolete, the building
OL,21,Fsoon fell into disrepair.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
