OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow a historical lighthouse was
OL,4,Asaved from dereliction
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was only saved when a group of local
OL,7,Fpeople took action and, in 1989, the
OL,8,FFriends of Leasowe Lighthouse was set
OL,9,Fup. The group continues to maintain the
OL,10,Fbuilding to this day.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
